@startuml "Template Method - Task - Class Diagram"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide empty members
title A repeated task

abstract class Task {
  # name : String
  # interval : int
  # repetation : int
  + {final} run()
  + prepare()
  + before()
  + {abstract} doTask()
  + after()
  + clean()
}
class Fax {
  + doTask()
}
class Print {
  + prepare()
  + doTask()
  + clean()
}
class Scan {
  + doTask()
}

Task <|-- Fax
Task <|-- Print
Task <|-- Scan

note right of Task
  <b>run() is the template method, and final.</b>
  prepare, then (before, doTask, after) as
  many times as asked, then clean.
  doTask() must be written; the others are
  hooks with a default.
end note
@enduml
